{
    "_notes": "Bela Trill Bar - 1D capacitive touch, 26 channels, up to 5 simultaneous touches. CENTROID mode. Identify cmd returns device_type=1 in byte 1 of 3-byte response. Address jumper-configurable 0x20-0x27.",
